.git/
# Alt-index plumbing for the sandboxed bridge-git setup. It surfaces in worker
# worktrees' `git status`, where the parallel collector wrongly treats it as an
# out-of-touch-set change and quarantines an otherwise-good stream. Never a real edit.
.git-alt*
